      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor asked the family to read or photograph key non-identifying items from the papers, checked vitals including SpO2 97%, temperature 36.5°C, pulse 87/min, respiratory rate 21/min, blood pressure 162/95mmHg, identified known diagnoses, and explicitly noted important unknowns.",
