        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor gave a safe, bounded response to the family's medication question and warned against self-stopping, self-switching, doubling, or refusing antibiotics, oxygen, nebulization, expectorants, antihypertensives, statin/cardiovascular medicines without clinician direction.",
